  "title": "Improved handling of short-lived secrets in remote execution",
  "summary": "BuildBuddy has supported passing short-lived secrets to remote actions via the env-overrides platform property, which redacts values from action cache entries. The new secret-env-overrides and secret-env-overrides-base64 properties extend this protection by also redacting values from workflow logs.",
